# Moving between screens: "that opens", "Open" after steps, a failed press that does not move, and remembered
# values that start again when a screen is opened again.
# do: press "Settings"
# do: type "Your name" "Ada"
# do: press "Save"
# do: type "Your name" ""
# do: press "Save and go home"
# do: type "Your name" "Grace"
# do: press "Save and go home"
# do: press "Settings"

Screen Home:
  Receive greeting as text ("Welcome" if not given)
  Show a heading: greeting
  Show a button "Settings" that opens Settings

Screen Settings:
  Remember name as text, starting at ""
  Remember saved starting at 0
  Show a heading "Settings"
  Show a text box "Your name" for name
  Show "Saved {saved} times."
  Show a button "Save":
    When pressed:
      Increase saved by 1
  Show a button "Save and go home":
    When pressed:
      When name is empty:
        Stop with "Type a name first."
      Increase saved by 1
      Open Home
  Show a button "Back" that opens Home
